  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"378\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Этот модпак находится в стадии предварительного релиза! Весь контент доступен, и все концовки можно достичь!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>До выхода версии 1.0 возможны обновления баланса!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">Автообновление CurseForge часто сбрасывает путевые точки и привязки клавиш.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Чтобы сохранить их при обновлении, установите модпак в новый профиль, а затем скопируйте папки 'saves' и 'journeymap', а также файл 'options.txt'!&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Нажмите</strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshorturl.at%252f7HBff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>здесь</strong></a> <strong>, чтобы получить настройку Java 25!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d4184\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_promo.png\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fWVvVm7aWh3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KI1Onh.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"70\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fmeatballcraft-dimensional-ascension%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOysJ7C.png\" width=\"184\" height=\"70\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dKWGAX4ZRGWUWQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7FayrGX.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"85\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WFlIQ5o.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"1126\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_4.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jk6jPYM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vLY13No.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v0zQ672.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3oOLqT0.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7PqWi5E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pEo7088.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YqPcAbi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><br><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/7daa283c-507b-4b22-9f31-ff19a4720d91\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DyiZbKy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lBBnuZA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/da0527a4-aa9b-4460-b74f-d4e32f4daffa\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/da0527a4-aa9b-4460-b74f-d4e32f4daffa\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/da0527a4-aa9b-4460-b74f-d4e32f4daffa\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/f38e035a-b47b-4dc5-9bd8-de9b09d74bea\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.i